  "notes": "Smoke-only OTA. The blocking local density menu now services the task watchdog on every scheduler wait, preventing the ESP32-C3 radio/reset gap that Android reported as supervision timeout 0x08 during physical mode changes. Every physical density change is published immediately to the phone with the established 0x20-0x23 status and backed by a queued diagnostics snapshot. Entering manual density mode no longer latches the previous battery frame at the new brightness, removing the intermittent transition flash. Twin Button firmware content remains unchanged.",
